# Spectrum Example: Chlorophyll-a (Chl a)

This directory contains an example for generating the absorption spectrum of the Chlorophyll-a (Chl a) system.

## Files

- `Theoretical_data.dat`  
  Data calculated using the BE model.  
  - Column 1: Excitation energy  
  - Column 2: Oscillator strength  

- `Experiment_data.dat`  
  Experimental data obtained using the digitizing tool:  
  https://app.digitizer.starrydata.org/

- `plot_final.py`  
  Python script that reads the above files and generates the spectrum plot.  
  A full width at half maximum (FWHM) of **10 nm** was used.

## Notes

A similar procedure can be followed to generate spectrum plots for other systems.
